### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### List usages (verified only by default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usages
Accept: application/json

### Filter by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usages?status=diverifikasi
Accept: application/json

### Filter pending verification
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usages?status=dicatat
Accept: application/json

### Get usage records for an item
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/5/usages
Accept: application/json

### Create usage record (bahan consumption)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/usages
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "item_id": 5,
  "item_unit_id": null,
  "user_id": 2,
  "quantity_used": 29.94,
  "quantity_before": 100.00,
  "quantity_after": 70.06,
  "purpose": "Penggunaan untuk analisis sampel air",
  "status": "dicatat"
}

### Verify usage record
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/usages/1/verify
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "verified_by": 1,
  "status": "diverifikasi"
}

### Reject usage record
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/usages/1/reject
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "rejected_by": 1,
  "rejection_reason": "Kuantitas tidak sesuai dengan rekaman penggunaan"
}

### Get single usage record
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usages/1
Accept: application/json